Package: uke-kernel-candidate-core
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, uke-kernel-candidate-modules (= ${binary:Version}), uke-kernel-candidate-dtbs (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Uke kernel candidate for source and payload qualification
 Non-bootable first-pass Image and configuration from the shared Fedora source
 composition. Stored outside boot and live module directories. No initramfs,
 boot bundle, activation hook or qualified kernel capability is provided.

Package: uke-kernel-candidate-modules
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, uke-kernel-candidate-dtbs (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Exact Uke kernel candidate module set
 Modules staged outside the live module tree for candidate inspection only.
 No installation hook loads modules or selects a kernel.

Package: uke-kernel-candidate-dtbs
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Exact Uke kernel candidate device tree
 Device tree retained with the exact candidate source and kernel release.
 Installing this package does not apply the device tree or select a boot entry.
